WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:03.650
Wealth, fame, power...

3
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

4
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.660
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

5
00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.660
You want my treasure?

6
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.450
Go ahead.

7
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.660
Find it!

8
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.250
Everything is right where I left it!

9
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:26.380
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

10
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.630
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

11
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.640
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

12
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.440
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

13
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.690
One Piece!

14
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

15
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

16
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

17
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

18
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.710
When the world's got you down,

19
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

20
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.190
Their biorhythm will carry you through

21
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
We're gonna make the most of it

22
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.400
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

23
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.990
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

24
00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.040
Got some change to my name,

25
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.250
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

26
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.130
We are, we are on the cruise!

27
00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.760
WE ARE!

28
00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:59.140
[GENZO]
You just
never learn, do you?

29
00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:01.810
[NAMI]
Let go! I'll pay you later

30
00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:02.940
any way you want.

31
00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:05.610
[BELL-MÈRE]
You made a boy cry?

32
00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:07.570
[NOJIKO]
He made me mad!

33
00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:09.650
[MOTHER]
Oh, it's okay.
Kids will be kids.

34
00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:11.740
[NAMI]
He said your tangerines suck.

35
00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:12.570
[BELL-MÈRE]
He what?!

36
00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:13.530
[MOTHER]
Bell-mère!

37
00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:16.450
[BELL-MÈRE]
Never give up...

38
00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:22.490
You must find the strength inside you
to always move on...

39
00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:26.710
You must live through every moment.

40
00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:37.510
[BELL-MÈRE]
And if you can smile in the face
of it all, that is the greatest strength.

41
00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:43.640
<b>Live</b>

42
00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:43.640
[NAMI, NOJIKO]
– Bell-mère!
– Bell-mère!

43
00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:49.570
While I'm in charge
those without money will die!

44
00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:52.280
Now do you understand
me, you worms?!

45
00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:56.280
[HATCHAN]
What's this?

46
00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:58.410
A map?

47
00:02:58.410 --> 00:02:59.370
[NAMI]
No!

48
00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:02.780
That's my map! I drew it.
You can't have it!

49
00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:04.830
A child drew this?

50
00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:06.970
Give it back!

51
00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.970
[NOJIKO]
Nami, No!

52
00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:08.670
[ARLONG]
Hmmm...

53
00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:11.000
Very good.

54
00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.590
[ARLONG]
She could be useful.

55
00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:15.280
Bring her with us.

56
00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:15.780
[HATCHAN]
Right!

57
00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.760
Waaaah! No! Help!

58
00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:22.220
Let her go! Let her go!

59
00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.220
[GENZO]
Wait!

60
00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:24.480
You promised not to hurt her

61
00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:26.480
if you got your money.

62
00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:29.690
Right, I won't hurt
her, just borrow her for a while.

63
00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:31.440
Genzo, help me.

64
00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.110
I won't let you take her.

65
00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.800
Kuroobi.

66
00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.600
Genzo!

67
00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.290
Genzo! Genzo!

68
00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:44.250
GENZO!

69
00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:52.840
I'll... I'll save you Nami...

70
00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:55.300
I won't let you go.

71
00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:59.890
No, please...! It's okay...!
You don't need to save me!

72
00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:00.890
Enough of this!

73
00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:03.170
[GENZO]
I will... save you.

74
00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:09.400
[NAMI]
Please, no more killing!

75
00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:22.070
[DOCTOR]
All of our ships
have been sunk...

76
00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:26.540
I'm afraid our plan to have Nami
and Nojiko escape to the sea was

77
00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:28.000
a bad plan.

78
00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:31.500
The Marines won't bother
trying to save us...

79
00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.380
We've lost our island.

80
00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:35.880
Bell-mère knew
that this would happen...

81
00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:40.720
Her experiences in the Marines taught
her what all these creatures are capable of.

82
00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:44.350
She knew that none
of us would escape.

83
00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:48.940
[NOJIKO sobs]

84
00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:51.150
They've taken Nami...

85
00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.060
What am I supposed to do now?

86
00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:55.920
Bell-mère...

87
00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.530
[DOCTOR]
We know where Arlong
and his crew are!

88
00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:05.620
It looks like they're going
to settle right here on this island...

89
00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:07.410
It's time to decide.

90
00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:09.660
We can fight to the death right now

91
00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:12.920
or we can take a chance
that the Marines will some day

92
00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:15.550
come to save us and hope and pray
we don't get killed before then...

93
00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:16.750
Your choice!

94
00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:20.470
[GENZO]
Only Marine headquarters
stands a chance against them.

95
00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:23.970
But they have their hands full
with the Grand Line...

96
00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:28.100
The chances that they would come
all the way out here for us are as good as zero.

97
00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:31.480
But I can't just sit here
and abandon Nami...

98
00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:32.810
We must fight.

99
00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:36.940
I'm in...

100
00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:40.030
I can't just stand by and do nothing
when a child is in danger.

101
00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:42.530
Now who else will come
fight beside us?

102
00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:45.620
I don't care if they kill me, I'm going
to save that little brat.

103
00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:48.410
[VILLAGER 3]
Bell-mère gave her life
for those girls, we should do no less!

104
00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:49.870
[VILLAGER 4]
Let's fight!

105
00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:53.590
[VILLAGER 5]
If just one of us fights
they'll blame us all, so let's do it!

106
00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.800
[NOJIKO]
Nami! Nami!

107
00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:03.550
[VILLAGER 1]
Nami!

108
00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:04.430
[VILLAGER 2]
What?!

109
00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:05.340
[VILLAGER 3]
You're okay!

110
00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:07.510
[NOJIKO]
Nami, Nami...!

111
00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:11.730
Are you okay...?
Did they hurt you any?

112
00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:15.270
Hey...

113
00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:18.320
[NAMI]
I'm... joining them.

114
00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:19.150
[NOJIKO]
Huh?

115
00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:23.740
[NAMI]
I'm joining Arlong's crew.

116
00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:26.950
I'll get to be a navigator
and draw maps.

117
00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:34.040
Heh... What in the world
are you talking about?

118
00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.540
Stand back...

119
00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:39.250
Did they threaten to do
something terrible to you...?

120
00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.840
Please... tell me.

121
00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:41.510
[NAMI]
No.

122
00:06:41.510 --> 00:06:42.880
They must have done something!

123
00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:43.840
No!

124
00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.300
Tell the truth!

125
00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.340
[NAMI]
Let go of me!

126
00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.390
Nami.

127
00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:49.950
[gasping]

128
00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:51.240
[NOJIKO]
No!

129
00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:55.310
But... that's an... Arlong tattoo.

130
00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:57.190
Not you.

131
00:06:57.860 --> 00:06:58.980
But why?

132
00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.860
Look at this...

133
00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:04.360
They gave me all this money.

134
00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:10.450
Heh heh... They say...
they'll buy me anything I want.

135
00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:11.740
[NOJIKO]
No...!

136
00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:14.870
I will never forgive you if you join
them! Don't you understand?!

137
00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.580
They killed Bell-mère in front of us!

138
00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.460
She died to keep us safe.

139
00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.800
I'll never forgive you! Never!

140
00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:23.340
You're not my sister! Who cares?

141
00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:26.430
Why would I want to live like Bell-mère
if it just gets you killed?

142
00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:29.430
I don't wanna die like that!

143
00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:32.970
[NOJIKO]
How could you...?

144
00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.100
[NOJIKO]
Bell-mère...

145
00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:39.270
Bell-mère gave her life
so that you and I could go on living

146
00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.110
together.

147
00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:41.900
[GENZO]
That's enough, Nojiko!

148
00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:43.860
Leave us Nami!

149
00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:46.700
Never set foot in this village again!

150
00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.330
[NOJIKO]
Nami!

151
00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.840
[GENZO]
I don't understand.

152
00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:08.090
How could she betray her family like that?
For money? Bell-mère was like her mother.

153
00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.790
[NOJIKO]
Nami loved Bell-mère...

154
00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:23.570
I know she did.

155
00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:31.870
[NAMI]
Hey...

156
00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:34.870
[NAMI]
Didn't Bell-mère always say...

157
00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:37.370
..."Good things will

158
00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.750
come your way, as long as
you continue to live.

159
00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.910
Lots of good things."

160
00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.010
[NOJIKO]
Yes.

161
00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:48.970
[NAMI]
After Arlong took me

162
00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:51.890
I watched him sink five Marine ships
like they were toys.

163
00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:54.930
I don't think they'll send any more.

164
00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:57.930
We're on our own.

165
00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:02.300
So I decided I'd do something
about it. I made a deal with Arlong

166
00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.020
to buy Cocoyashi village from him.

167
00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.650
[NOJIKO]
Buy Cocoyashi? How?

168
00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:10.150
[NAMI]
For 100 million berries.

169
00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.370
If I buy the town, we'll be free.

170
00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:17.910
No else will die.

171
00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:21.120
And all I have to do is join
his crew and draw maps.

172
00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.630
[NOJIKO]
But 100 million berries!

173
00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:25.420
You can't earn that working
your whole life.

174
00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:27.170
[NAMI]
I will get that money

175
00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:28.510
no matter what.

176
00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:33.970
People are having a hard enough time paying
their own tribute so I have to do this alone.

177
00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:37.770
If anyone tries to help me,
they'll just get hurt.

178
00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:45.610
[NOJIKO]
Won't it be hard?

179
00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:47.270
[NAMI]
Yeah...

180
00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:50.530
[NOJIKO]
Living with the people
who killed our mother?

181
00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:51.530
[NAMI]
I'll be okay.

182
00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.530
I'll just smile

183
00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:57.650
every time I see his face.
I'm not going to cry anymore.

184
00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.620
I'm going to fight by myself.

185
00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.600
[NOJIKO]
To make a choice like that

186
00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:26.690
when you're only ten years
old. Do you know how

187
00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:28.820
hard that must have been?

188
00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:33.360
All to save the village
she loved so much...

189
00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:34.110
That girl...

190
00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:38.880
Ahhhh! Whoever makes
Nami suffer's going to hear from me!

191
00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:41.620
Why'd you do that?

192
00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:42.790
Because...

193
00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:45.370
I'm telling you to stay out of it...

194
00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.750
If you go around saying
that she's your friend,

195
00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.500
they're going to become
suspicious of her.

196
00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:53.320
Then her eight years of suffering
will have been for nothing.

197
00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.550
Don't make it harder
than it already is.

198
00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:59.310
She has to fight alone.
Knowing there are people

199
00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:02.810
who call her "friend" only makes
the suffering worse.

200
00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:19.620
Get back here you little brat!

201
00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:22.120
[PIRATE B]
Stop!

202
00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:24.330
[NOJIKO]
A pirate thief?

203
00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:26.120
[NAMI]
That's right.

204
00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:29.590
The only thing this place has going
for it is plenty of pirates to steal from.

205
00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:31.880
[NAMI]
I'm gonna make 'em pay!

206
00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:34.220
[NOJIKO]
You're all cut up!

207
00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:38.180
[NAMI]
Yeah, I kinda screwed up.
But look, one million berries.

208
00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:40.850
[NOJIKO]
Who cares about that?
You need a doctor!

209
00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:42.770
[NAMI]
It's nothing,
these cuts are nothing!

210
00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:46.100
[NAMI]
No one will find it here.

211
00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:48.810
I'll save up little by little.

212
00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:52.620
By the time this is filled I'll have
my hundred million.

213
00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:56.820
[NAMI]
Still a long way to go.

214
00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:01.000
[NAMI]
100 million Berries...

215
00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:06.620
It's taken a while but only seven million left...

216
00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:11.750
I can get that with one more job...

217
00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:14.800
Just one more trip
and this will finally be over.

218
00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:20.890
Arlong's rule will be over...
Cocoyashi village will be free...

219
00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:22.510
I will be free

220
00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:25.020
and then...

221
00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:30.390
And then I think I'll finally be able
to smile again for real.

222
00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:33.270
Bell-mère...

223
00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:52.920
[GENZO]
So why
do the Marines want Nami?

224
00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:56.630
[NEZUMI]
Your job
is to lead the way, quietly.

225
00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:03.180
A hat pinwheel... Where
in the world did he get that?

226
00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:05.260
It's so cool.

227
00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.320
One more little job... Let's get to it.

228
00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:21.700
[NAMI thinking]
Genzo...?

229
00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.200
And the Marines?

230
00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:30.410
Are you the pirate thief
known as Nami?

231
00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.030
The Marine's sources have revealed...

232
00:13:34.030 --> 00:13:37.340
That you have quite a large sum of treasure
that you've stolen from pirates...

233
00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:40.610
The government hereby confiscates
everything you've stolen...

234
00:13:40.610 --> 00:13:43.720
It is required that you comply
immediately. Do you understand?

235
00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.810
I'm only going to warn you once...

236
00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:50.060
I'm one of the leaders
of the Arlong Pirates...

237
00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:53.150
If you mess with me,
Arlong won't sit by quietly.

238
00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:55.900
Chichichi... Silly girl...

239
00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:59.650
Who do you think I am? Do you honestly think
you can intimidate me...?

240
00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.200
Find the stolen goods!

241
00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:04.810
Don't move.

242
00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:12.120
I said stop!

243
00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:19.960
Do you really think this is what
the Marines should be doing now?

244
00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:23.840
The Arlong Pirates are murderers;
they've destroyed entire cities and

245
00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.050
you're doing nothing!

246
00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:29.260
He's ruling over this island
and trampling over people's lives!

247
00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:34.600
You'd ignore Arlong's atrocities to steal
from a thief...? Is that what you stand for?!

248
00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:38.360
Chichichi... Big talk
from a filthy criminal...

249
00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:39.530
Ha... Continue the search men.

250
00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:44.530
Every person on this island has been waiting
for the Marines to come and help them for years!

251
00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:48.030
How dare you pass them by and come
here searching for money!

252
00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:51.200
[MARINE C]
Colonel...! This tangerine orchard
seems a little suspicious!

253
00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.250
[NEZUMI]
Dig it up!
The whole thing if need be!

254
00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:59.500
Keep your filthy hands
off Bell-mère's tangerine orchard!

255
00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.220
I won't let you take my money...!

256
00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:06.470
That money's for... It's for...!

257
00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.720
That poor girl's money is meant
to save Cocoyashi Village...!

258
00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:16.940
What gives you the right to take
our salvation away from her?! Damn you!

259
00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:20.320
My my...

260
00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:23.900
A mere village representative talking down
to a Marine colonel. How bold.

261
00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.280
Genzo...

262
00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.240
How'd you know about that?

263
00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:34.080
I've always known... Nami.

264
00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:39.960
[GENZO]
I couldn't believe
what you had done...

265
00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.840
So I confronted Nojiko about it later.

266
00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:44.260
Since then,

267
00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:48.800
everyone has known that you stayed with the
Arlong Pirates so that you could save the village.

268
00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:52.180
But we all agreed we'd never tell
you that we knew...

269
00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:55.060
If you ever thought the villagers
were placing their hopes on you,

270
00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:58.270
you might never leave
his gang for fear of letting us down.

271
00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.520
That can't be...

272
00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.900
Now hold on a minute,
just what are you trying to say here?

273
00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:10.320
Are you telling me that the villagers are thieves,
and we should arrest every one of them...?

274
00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:11.700
Is that what you're saying?

275
00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:16.290
[NOJIKO]
What he's saying
is that every last one of us is fighting to survive

276
00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:17.960
[NOJIKO]
We have
to fend for ourselves

277
00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:20.670
because we can't rely on support
from you government people!

278
00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:24.710
So if you're not gonna protect
our village, then get the hell outta here!

279
00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:28.590
And be quick about it,
or Arlong'll sink your ship too!

280
00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.470
Arlong will...?

281
00:16:30.470 --> 00:16:32.300
I wouldn't be so sure.

282
00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.180
You still haven't found it...?!

283
00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:40.360
We're looking for 100 million berries
here, not a grain of rice!

284
00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:42.310
[GENZO]
Hey you!

285
00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:43.940
How do you know
how much there is?!

286
00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:47.950
Oh... I don't know...

287
00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:51.320
I just have a hunch that that's
the amount we're looking for.

288
00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:04.130
It's him...

289
00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:08.870
[ARLONG laughs]

290
00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:12.010
Tell me...! It was Arlong
that sent you wasn't it?!

291
00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.390
Chichichi... 'Course not...

292
00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:17.580
I wouldn't do a pirate's dirty work,
that'd be wrong...

293
00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:21.560
I'm just a public servant dealing with theft
the way any government worker would.

294
00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.980
You corrupt marine scumbag!

295
00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:27.610
The Marines have stooped
to being nothing but pirate cronies!

296
00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:30.740
[NAMI thinking]
Arlong!

297
00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.490
[MARINE G]
Sir, I found it!

298
00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:42.750
[NEZUMI]
Incredible!

299
00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:45.960
I must say I'm impressed
you gathered this much treasure!

300
00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:48.260
The money's all ragged and bloody.

301
00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:50.420
No matter... Money's money!

302
00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:56.350
[thinking]
Thirty percent
of this is all mine!

303
00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:58.270
[NAMI]
Don't touch that...

304
00:17:58.770 --> 00:18:02.600
Don't touch that... Don't touch that...

305
00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:04.350
Nami...

306
00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.940
Stop it... Don't touch that!

307
00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.570
Stop it!

308
00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:31.760
Nojiko!

309
00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:33.970
Nojiko!

310
00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:41.810
[GENZO]
Doctor! Doctor!

311
00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:44.690
[DOCTOR]
Genzo! What is it?!

312
00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:46.100
[GENZO]
Nojiko's been shot!

313
00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.310
[DOCTOR]
By who?!

314
00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:48.440
[GENZO]
The Marines.

315
00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:49.270
[DOCTOR]
The Marines?!

316
00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:55.570
Nami.

317
00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:57.910
Hey Nami...!

318
00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:00.240
What's up?! Need help
with anything?!

319
00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:04.000
Why are you still here?

320
00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:08.750
Stay outta my business...!
Just get away from our island!

321
00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:17.220
[NAMI thinking]
Arlong...

322
00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:20.140
I bet it's the village...
You want it left alone?

323
00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:22.180
Arlong!

324
00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:25.190
Gather up 100 million berries,
then bring it to me...

325
00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:28.980
Do so and I will let your village go in addition
to giving you your freedom.

326
00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:30.730
Arlong!

327
00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:34.990
And I'm the kind of fishman who would rather
die than break an agreement concerning money.

328
00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:37.110
And I don't even care
how long it takes you,

329
00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:38.780
I will honor our agreement.

330
00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:41.120
[NAMI]
Arlong!

331
00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:47.710
What's her problem?

332
00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:51.380
[NAMI]
Arlong!

333
00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:52.290
[GROUP]
– Hmm?
– Hmm?

334
00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.420
[ARLONG]
Hmm? Ah...

335
00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:58.010
What seems to be the problem,
O skilled surveyor of ours?

336
00:19:58.010 --> 00:20:00.260
Why the sour face?

337
00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:04.770
Those Marine maggots you keep
on the payroll stole every last berry I had!

338
00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:07.690
What happened to all that crap about dying

339
00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:09.770
before you'd ever break a promise
when it comes to money...?!

340
00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:11.270
Bastard!

341
00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:13.480
Refresh my memory.
Did I break a promise?

342
00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:17.020
Don't play dumb with me! I know that
you teamed up with the Marines to–

343
00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:21.160
Just when did I break
that promise...?

344
00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:22.200
Speak up girl.

345
00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:32.170
[NAMI thinking]
Damn you...

346
00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:34.250
Damn you! Damn you!

347
00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.340
Too bad...

348
00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:39.180
All your stolen money got stolen...

349
00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:41.720
That certainly is unfortunate...

350
00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:44.060
But a deal is a deal Nami...

351
00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:47.060
If you can't come up
with 100 million berries,

352
00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:50.010
then both you and your village stay
in my possession indefinitely.

353
00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:52.190
Well, you know the terms. Hmm?

354
00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:53.690
You pig!

355
00:20:56.780 --> 00:20:58.950
It's only 100 million berries!

356
00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:01.660
Start saving again
and you'll have it in no time!

357
00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:07.500
Or, are you gonna run out on me?

358
00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:13.920
Listen... If you do that, I'll kill everyone
in that village. Do you understand me?

359
00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:18.920
[GENZO]
Nami...

360
00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:21.680
We agreed we would never tell
you that we knew...

361
00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:24.930
If you thought all of us were counting
on you, you would be

362
00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:28.730
bound by guilt never to leave
his gang for fear of letting us down.

363
00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:34.650
Aww...

364
00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:36.780
Running away so soon?

365
00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:41.700
Shouldn't we chase after her?

366
00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:43.820
[ARLONG]
No need for that.

367
00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:46.830
Trust me Hachi
she's not going anywhere...

368
00:21:46.830 --> 00:21:51.330
There's no way Nami could just abandon
the lives of all those villagers.

369
00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:55.210
[CHOO]
Choo. Now that's
what I call playing dirty.

370
00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:59.420
There's no way I'd let go
of an asset like Nami that easily.

371
00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:02.680
I may be cruel but I'm not
totally heartless.

372
00:22:04.180 --> 00:22:09.270
Once she's done charting
all the world's oceans, she'll have her freedom.

373
00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:11.770
[laughter]

374
00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:15.400
That's pretty harsh man,
it'll take decades for sure.

375
00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:18.190
Yeah, I bet a hundred years
wouldn't be enough!

376
00:22:26.910 --> 00:22:28.740
We've had enough...! Take up arms!

377
00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:29.830
It's time to fight!

378
00:22:30.720 --> 00:22:31.640
[SANJI]
Yeah!

379
00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:38.750
[NAMI thinking]
Genzo! Please!
Don't do anything stupid!

380
00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:41.420
We have to live or our struggles
will mean nothing!

381
00:22:42.010 --> 00:22:45.140
You can't throw your lives away!

382
00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:47.180
[GENZO]
Eight long years ago...

383
00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:50.680
We promised we wouldn't live
our lives in vain!

384
00:22:50.680 --> 00:22:53.180
No matter the pain or humiliation

385
00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:58.650
we endured under Arlong, we swore to fight the
long fight so Nami could meet their demands!

386
00:22:58.650 --> 00:23:01.360
But, they lied! They never intended

387
00:23:01.740 --> 00:23:06.320
to keep their end of the deal.
Instead they stole our only chance at freedom!

388
00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:07.240
So now...

389
00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:12.200
We should make those filthy fishmen pay for the
years they manipulated that kind young girl...!

390
00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:13.000
Am I right?!

391
00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:15.250
[VILLAGER E]
Yeah! Let's do this!

392
00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:19.040
[VILLAGER H]
We were always ready
to fight those monsters! Let's get 'em!

393
00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:22.170
Time to show those lousy stinkin'
fishmen what we're made of!

394
00:23:23.150 --> 00:23:23.940
Yeah!

395
00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:27.350
[NAMI]
Everybody! Wait! Huh?

396
00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:29.050
[NOJIKO]
Nami!

397
00:23:32.350 --> 00:23:33.850
Calm down...!

398
00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:35.480
It's not that much money...!

399
00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:37.730
I can make it back in no time...!

400
00:23:37.730 --> 00:23:39.770
I'll take care of it, don't worry!

401
00:23:40.270 --> 00:23:41.900
It'll be easy... this time!

402
00:23:41.900 --> 00:23:46.150
I'm used to it! I'll be fine!
Just relax! Everything is okay!

403
00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:50.350
Hey... It's nothing
compared to back then.

404
00:23:51.830 --> 00:23:53.790
It's okay...!
You don't need to save me!

405
00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:55.410
C'mon everyone!

406
00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:58.040
I'm perfectly fine!

407
00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:05.590
You've done enough...

408
00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:07.680
You have to know
that there is no point now.

409
00:24:08.550 --> 00:24:13.010
You struggled so hard, carrying
our lives on your back this whole time.

410
00:24:13.010 --> 00:24:16.390
I can only imagine that joining
them must have been more painful,

411
00:24:16.390 --> 00:24:18.980
than being stabbed through the heart.

412
00:24:19.980 --> 00:24:22.360
[GENZO]
You fought very well.

413
00:24:23.860 --> 00:24:25.150
[NAMI]
Genzo...

414
00:24:31.280 --> 00:24:33.410
Set yourself free from this village.

415
00:24:35.080 --> 00:24:36.530
[NAMI]
Genzo!

416
00:24:36.870 --> 00:24:38.330
[NOJIKO]
Nami. Do it.

417
00:24:38.330 --> 00:24:39.710
[NAMI]
What?! Nojiko!

418
00:24:40.460 --> 00:24:41.460
Nami...

419
00:24:41.460 --> 00:24:42.540
Go on.

420
00:24:43.670 --> 00:24:46.920
You are an exceptional young woman...
And you have a dream.

421
00:24:46.920 --> 00:24:48.680
Everyone! Listen!

422
00:24:49.650 --> 00:24:51.510
I won't let you go...!

423
00:24:52.680 --> 00:24:54.180
Just stay right there...!

424
00:24:54.180 --> 00:24:57.060
I'm not going to let any one else
get hurt by these monsters!

425
00:24:59.690 --> 00:25:00.810
You'll all die...

426
00:25:01.810 --> 00:25:03.150
We know that.

427
00:25:08.990 --> 00:25:12.320
Nami... It's no use,
we've made up our minds!

428
00:25:16.040 --> 00:25:17.620
Get outta the way!

429
00:25:19.620 --> 00:25:21.170
[GENZO]
Move out!

430
00:25:21.170 --> 00:25:25.400
[DOCTOR]
We may not win
but we will give 'em hell!

431
00:26:04.710 --> 00:26:07.340
Arlong!

432
00:26:09.590 --> 00:26:10.340
Arlong!

433
00:26:10.340 --> 00:26:14.890
Arlong! Arlong! Arlong!
Arlong! Arlong! Arlong!

434
00:26:21.100 --> 00:26:22.440
Luffy.

435
00:26:26.190 --> 00:26:27.650
[NAMI]
What do you want?

436
00:26:27.650 --> 00:26:29.780
You don't know anything about this.

437
00:26:29.780 --> 00:26:33.570
You don't know what's been happening
on this island for the past eight years.

438
00:26:33.570 --> 00:26:35.320
[LUFFY]
Nope. I don't.

439
00:26:36.120 --> 00:26:37.700
This has nothing to do with you!

440
00:26:38.540 --> 00:26:41.160
I told you to leave this place.

441
00:26:41.160 --> 00:26:43.160
Yep... You sure did.

442
00:26:43.160 --> 00:26:44.420
[NAMI]
So leave...!

443
00:26:44.420 --> 00:26:45.790
I told you to leave...!

444
00:26:45.790 --> 00:26:48.130
Get out of here...! Get out

445
00:26:48.130 --> 00:26:49.380
of here now...!

446
00:26:49.380 --> 00:26:52.880
Go...! Go away...! Go...! Go...! Go!

447
00:27:07.810 --> 00:27:08.980
[NAMI]
Luffy...

448
00:27:10.480 --> 00:27:11.860
Help me.

449
00:27:18.530 --> 00:27:22.290
[LUFFY]
Of course...
That's what friends do.

450
00:27:24.120 --> 00:27:26.670
He's gonna pay!

451
00:27:29.540 --> 00:27:32.390
You better keep
your hands off my hat.

452
00:27:33.880 --> 00:27:35.220
[NAMI]
Luffy.

453
00:27:41.680 --> 00:27:43.090
Let's go!

454
00:27:44.180 --> 00:27:45.140
Right!

455
00:27:49.520 --> 00:27:50.570
[VILLAGER A]
Hey!

456
00:27:50.570 --> 00:27:52.360
Are you guys alright?

457
00:27:52.360 --> 00:27:54.320
[DOCTOR]
Did Arlong do this to you?

458
00:27:55.860 --> 00:27:57.070
[GENZO]
Move aside!

459
00:27:57.950 --> 00:28:01.330
We have business to take care
of with the fishmen.

460
00:28:01.330 --> 00:28:03.830
When we finally found out
the truth about big sis Nami...

461
00:28:03.830 --> 00:28:07.830
We realized the only thing
we could do was defeat Arlong in battle...

462
00:28:07.830 --> 00:28:10.340
So we decided to come back here
and challenge him.

463
00:28:10.340 --> 00:28:12.960
Yeah... Then we lost,
but only by a hair.

464
00:28:14.800 --> 00:28:19.050
I'm sorry but I can't let you through this door...
You have no chance of victory.

465
00:28:19.050 --> 00:28:20.010
What's that?

466
00:28:20.350 --> 00:28:24.430
Be patient... It won't be long now. You see
we're waiting for the arrival of certain men.

467
00:28:25.060 --> 00:28:26.520
What "certain men"?

468
00:28:26.980 --> 00:28:29.100
[YOSAKU]
Don't worry.
They'll be here soon...

469
00:28:29.100 --> 00:28:31.610
I'd bet my life on it!

470
00:28:46.700 --> 00:28:47.460
– There!
– There!

471
00:29:03.470 --> 00:29:04.560
It's them...

472
00:29:04.560 --> 00:29:07.600
But why would they come
to defend our village?

473
00:29:08.060 --> 00:29:10.690
If those men can't handle
Arlong and his gang,

474
00:29:10.690 --> 00:29:15.530
then there really is no hope... Not only
for this island but for the whole East Blue.

475
00:29:16.230 --> 00:29:19.610
[JOHNNY]
Those are the faces of the four men
who are here to change your destiny...

476
00:29:19.610 --> 00:29:23.120
Burn their images into your memory!

477
00:29:32.040 --> 00:29:33.170
[LUFFY]
Step aside.

478
00:29:33.170 --> 00:29:40.220
[ARLONG laughs]

479
00:29:40.220 --> 00:29:45.050
Hey. Do you think those two idiots that showed
up earlier are members of Zoro's little crew?

480
00:29:45.430 --> 00:29:48.180
Zoro? They seemed
too weak for that...

481
00:29:48.180 --> 00:29:49.850
They weren't even worth killing.

482
00:29:49.850 --> 00:29:51.640
That's for sure!

483
00:30:05.200 --> 00:30:06.530
What the–

484
00:30:09.250 --> 00:30:11.370
Now which one of you is Arlong?

485
00:30:15.390 --> 00:30:20.380
More feelings than I can hold but I can’t make you understand

486
00:30:20.400 --> 00:30:25.240
Be that as it may, I just can’t bear to let go of your hand

487
00:30:25.290 --> 00:30:30.190
I’ve still gotta move, even if I’m alone I’ll walk along

488
00:30:30.230 --> 00:30:35.460
Just promise that you’ll still keep an eye on me when I am gone Just promise that you’ll still keep an eye on me when I am gone

489
00:30:40.110 --> 00:30:44.990
As soon as I woke up, couldn’t get it off my mind

490
00:30:45.040 --> 00:30:49.740
“Why the hell’s it so hot? I can hardly breathe!”

491
00:30:49.740 --> 00:30:56.250
